Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:01.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What if a few lines of code
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.78,0:00:03.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}became the start of a new passion?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:12.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}With L9ITHA.Club, students discover\NPython programming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.15,0:00:16.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}in a structured computer club,\Nwith step-by-step activities
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.34,0:00:18.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and the support of their teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.45,0:00:20.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Two tracks, Junior and Pro,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.42,0:00:22.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}offer a progression suited to each age.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.59,0:00:24.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We warm up, practise with guidance,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:27.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}practise on our own, then take on a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.45,0:00:34.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Students write their code, run it\Nand watch the result.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:38.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hints and messages in French\Nhelp them understand their mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:40.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They fix it, try again and move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.77,0:00:43.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Their work is saved\Nfor the next session.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.45,0:00:50.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For parents, it's a supervised activity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.96,0:00:53.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to build logical thinking,\Nencourage creativity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:56.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and learn to persevere when facing a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:04.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For schools, the platform brings together\Nthe club's organisation,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.11,0:01:06.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the course materials and the exercises.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.19,0:01:09.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The teacher presents the session,\Nopens the activities
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.53,0:01:13.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and sees attendance, progress\Nand results for every student.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:18.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}From first attempts to coding challenges,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.76,0:01:21.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}every session invites students\Nto understand code
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and to bring their ideas to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.35,0:01:26.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Discover L9ITHA.Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.06,0:01:29.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}To join the club or request\Na demo, get in touch.
